      "message": "Decodes git\u0027s stdout with the platform default charset. Use `new String(bytes, UTF_8)` -- git\u0027s output isn\u0027t guaranteed to decode under a non-UTF-8 default. It also breaks the bazel build: `-Xep:DefaultCharset:ERROR` is enforced on test packages too (`tools/BUILD`; not relaxed in `exclude_in_tests`, and `//org.eclipse.jgit.test/...` is in `error_prone_packages_test`), so `bazel build //...` fails to compile this test. Maven CI stays green because it doesn\u0027t raise `DefaultCharset` to an error.",
